{"id":"ac4f07708b58159c","group":"57","path":"57/57-df-herbrand-base.md","title":"Herbrand Base","display":"df-herbrand-base — Herbrand Base","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)","book_abbrev":"57","label":"57-df-herbrand-base","aliases":["57-df-herbrand-base"],"display":"df-herbrand-base — Herbrand Base","depends_on":["[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Mathematical Logic (Ebbinghaus, Flum, Thomas)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"57"},{"key":"label","html":"57-df-herbrand-base"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>57-df-herbrand-base</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-herbrand-base — Herbrand Base"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a></span></div>"}],"html":"<h1 id=\"Herbrand-Base\">Herbrand Base</h1>\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"H_S=\\mathrm{HU}(S)\">\\(H_S=\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\)</span>，见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"d1505219185e27a3\" href=\"?note=d1505219185e27a3\" title=\"57-df-herbrand-universe\">57-df-herbrand-universe</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\">\\(\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\)</span> 见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d43696a63788f3df\" href=\"?note=d43696a63788f3df\" title=\"57-df-symbol-alphabet\">57-df-symbol-alphabet</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"n\\geq1\">\\(n\\geq1\\)</span>。本文件原来的基由关系符号应用构成，不把内建等号当作可任意赋真的谓词。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"B_S\\coloneqq\\{R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):n\\geq1\\land R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in H_S^n\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[B_S\\coloneqq\\{R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):n\\geq1\\land R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in H_S^n\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关系元数与输入项数一致；不再对任意签名字母 R 使用未声明的元数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Herbrand-Base","text":"Herbrand Base","level":1},{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-herbrand-universe]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-herbrand-universe","status":"resolved","id":"d1505219185e27a3","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H_S=\\mathrm{HU}(S)$，见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]；$\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$ 见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]，$n\\geq1$。本文件原来的基由关系符号应用构成，不把内建等号当作可任意赋真的谓词。","embed":false},{"target":"57-df-symbol-alphabet","status":"resolved","id":"d43696a63788f3df","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"$H_S=\\mathrm{HU}(S)$，见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]；$\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$ 见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]，$n\\geq1$。本文件原来的基由关系符号应用构成，不把内建等号当作可任意赋真的谓词。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"H_S=\\mathrm{HU}(S)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n","display":false},{"tex":"n\\geq1","display":false},{"tex":"B_S\\coloneqq\\{R(t_1,\\ldots,t_n):n\\geq1\\land R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n\\land(t_1,\\ldots,t_n)\\in H_S^n\\}.","display":true}],"bytes":756,"backlinks":[{"id":"336b1fe36586a678","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]；$\\mathrm{AtFml}_S$ 与 $\\models$ 见 [[57-df-atomic-formula]]、[[57-df-logical-consequence]]。$\\mathrm{CWA}(P)$ 保留原定义的正原子后承集合，既不改名，也不替换为带负文字的理论。另在 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$ 时，$A\\in B_S$、$\\mathfrak H_I(S)$ 见 [[57-df-herbrand-base]]、[[57-df-herbrand-structure]]；$\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}$ 为这个集合诱导的基原子真值结构。"},{"id":"ff7a0658d8cf65f6","anchor":"ref-7","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"假定 $\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$；$B_S$ 见 [[57-df-herbrand-universe]]、[[57-df-herbrand-base]]。固定参数 $I\\subseteq B_S$，表示被赋真的基关系原子。$c\\in\\mathrm{Const}_S$、$f\\in\\mathrm{Func}_S^n$、$R\\in\\mathrm{Rel}_S^n$、$n\\geq1$，见 [[57-df-symbol-alphabet]]。$\\mathfrak H(S)$ 保留原单参数写法，但其真原子集合 $I$ 是显式环境参数；$\\mathfrak H_I(S)$ 显示该参数。结构与项解释见 [[57-df-structure]]、[[57-df-term-interpretation]]。"},{"id":"931bc3d500f82dff","anchor":"ref-9","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，见 [[57-df-definite-program]]；子句矩阵 $A\\leftarrow B_1,\\ldots,B_n$ 见 [[57-df-horn-clause]]。限定这些矩阵原子均为关系应用，不含内建等号；$I\\subseteq B_S$，见 [[57-df-herbrand-base]]。$\\mathrm{GroundSubst}_S$、原子代换和 $\\mathrm{FV}$ 见 [[57-df-ground-substitution]]、[[57-df-substitution-application]]、[[57-df-free-variable]]。$\\mathrm{FV}(\\{A,B_1,\\ldots,B_n\\})$ 是矩阵变量，不是闭合子句的空自由变量集。"},{"id":"8f8f1ec72ff6ac85","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"0ae7f6f5eeeb49c1","anchor":"ref-6","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"固定 $P\\in\\mathrm{DefProg}$，其所有矩阵原子均为关系应用而非内建等号；$\\mathrm{HU}(S)\\neq\\emptyset$，$A\\in B_S$，见 [[57-df-herbrand-base]]。$\\mathrm{NAF}$、$\\mathrm{CWA}$ 和 $\\mathfrak M_{\\mathrm{CWA},P}$ 见 [[57-df-negation-as-failure]]、[[57-df-